  "description": "GOPXAO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C86 H74 Br10 Dy4 N8 O14,5(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.566-3.908 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.93-112.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)2(L1)4(L′)2]·5CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
